      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسِيفٌ</span></b>  One <i>having upon him a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَيْف</span> [or <i>sword</i>];
(S, O, K;) <i>having hung upon himself a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَيْف</span>:
(Ks:) and (K) accord. to Ibn-'Abbád, a <i>courageous</i> man <i>having with him a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَيْف</span>. (O, K.) ― 
